# Self-hosted scheduler — the docker-compose equivalent of web/vercel.json's
# `crons` array. Every line below is that file's schedule verbatim, curling
# the same route with the same Bearer auth Vercel Cron sends automatically.
# CRON_SECRET itself lives in /run/cron_secret (written by entrypoint.sh,
# root-only), not here or in argv, so it never shows up in `docker top`.
#
# min hour dom mon dow   command
